sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant AuthController
  participant AuthService
  participant API as Protected API Endpoint
  participant ScopeGuard as CondominiumAccessGuardMiddleware
  participant Db as HabitusDbContext

  User->>AuthController: POST /api/platform/auth/login
  AuthController->>AuthService: LoginAsync(credentials, ip, userAgent)
  AuthService-->>AuthController: token with Role + CondominiumId claims
  AuthController-->>User: 200 token payload

  User->>API: Request protected route with JWT
  API->>ScopeGuard: InvokeAsync(context, dbContext)
  ScopeGuard->>Db: Load condominium IsActive by claim CondominiumId
  alt role is Manager
    ScopeGuard-->>API: Allow request
  else condominium active
    ScopeGuard-->>API: Allow request
  else condominium inactive
    ScopeGuard-->>User: 423 condominium_inactive
  end
